Devarenu -- additional terms under section 7 of the GNU GPL v3
==============================================================

These terms supplement the GNU General Public License version 3 in the
file COPYING. They apply to all files of this program from version
0.5.0 on.

1. The name "Devarenu" (also written in Hebrew script) is not licensed
   under the GPL. No rights to use it are granted for modified versions
